25 November 2026, ~14:36 Europe/Copenhagen — User confirmed the slide-3 conclusions basis with two edits. Agreed summary for the deck:

1. Older transfers entered the Premier League less often (12.14% vs 14.56%, gap −2.42 pp), with limited evidence against the within-origin-club/season age shuffle (one-sided p = 0.098).
