3. Emphasise human validation: one author hand-labelled sentences (196 usable after excluding four wrong-person matches) to check model scores against human perception; RoBERTa had the strongest observed rank agreement (ρ = 0.52). Frame this as confirming validity relative to human judgement, not only as “useful but imperfect”.
4. Include the feeder-analysis finding: among recurring Premier League arrival routes, some high-volume pairs shared a common equity investor; the 17 joint-ownership pairs had a median of four transfers versus two for the remaining 200 pairs (Girona→Manchester City busiest, 15 observed vs 1.8 expected). Keep paper wording: exploratory / starting point, not a causal claim.

